{
  "Combat.Terra.TerraFlames.Name": "Terra Flames",
  "Combat.Terra.TerraFlames.Description": "Release the might of earth and flame to devastate the battlefield.",
  "Combat.Terra.TerraFlames.Text": "You plant your feet firmly on the ground and direct your energy into the earth, emerald flames billowing out around your feet as the ground begins to rumble. An instant later, the entire battlefield shudders and an inferno of terrestrial fire surges up from beneath!",
  "Combat.Terra.TerraFlames.Wreathed": "[pg-][Themonster] is wreathed in emerald flames."
}
